The project interoperates with Navidrome and OpenSubsonic but is not an official
Navidrome project. "Navidrome" is used only to describe compatibility.

The gateway uses these third-party components under their respective licenses:

- gorilla/websocket (BSD-2-Clause)
- modernc.org/sqlite and its transitive dependencies (BSD-style licenses)
- SQLite (public domain)
- Sigstore Cosign distributed in the container image (Apache-2.0)

The .ndp bridge uses Navidrome's Go Plugin Development Kit and Extism Go PDK.
Redistribution of build artifacts must retain all applicable notices and source
availability obligations.

MusicMate and FAIO are separate projects. No FAIO room data or media is bundled
with this repository.
